### Verify Mock Data in Azure
### To get adminToken: Login with siteadmin@petwhenua.co.nz / TestPass123! and copy the token

@azureBaseUrl = https://petwhenua-gpggdjawh0duc2du.australiaeast-01.azurewebsites.net
@adminToken = {{$processEnv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Check Mock Data Summary
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/admin/mock-data-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get Database Status
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/admin/database-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get All Posts (should show variety)
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/posts?page=1&pageSize=20

### Get All Users (should show multiple users)  
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20

### Test Login with Mock User
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "member01@petwhenua.co.nz",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### Test Login with Another Mock User
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "meetupadmin01@petwhenua.co.nz", 
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### Check Sample Image Access
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/uploads/samples/pets/cat-01.jpg

### Get Posts with Pagination Test
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/posts?page=1&pageSize=5

### Get Users by Location
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/users?location=Auckland&page=1&pageSize=10 